{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v45", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v45-v1", "input_hash": "bc3c901afbe82a606daf4c970b6e7f130991d5696f45917a5f49ee0b7762aeb9", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:49.989549+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Sadāśiva and Bhairava, likewise with serpents and the best of serpents.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v45", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v45-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bc3c901afbe82a606daf4c970b6e7f130991d5696f45917a5f49ee0b7762aeb9", "input_hash": "bc3c901afbe82a606daf4c970b6e7f130991d5696f45917a5f49ee0b7762aeb9"}}, "l2": {"text": "Sadāśiva and Bhairava, along with the serpent hosts and their foremost serpents.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v45", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v45-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bc3c901afbe82a606daf4c970b6e7f130991d5696f45917a5f49ee0b7762aeb9", "input_hash": "bc3c901afbe82a606daf4c970b6e7f130991d5696f45917a5f49ee0b7762aeb9"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v46", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v46-v1", "input_hash": "3740049f03e267be43acea357cc673c493f4fc05e221bbb79f301476e4a9f22e", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:50.031770+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "And as for humans, the truth-status (tathya) is impossible; but the skull-bearer (kapāladhṛk) [is so].", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v46", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v46-v1", "l0_input_hash": "3740049f03e267be43acea357cc673c493f4fc05e221bbb79f301476e4a9f22e", "input_hash": "3740049f03e267be43acea357cc673c493f4fc05e221bbb79f301476e4a9f22e"}}, "l2": {"text": "Among humans, however, this truth is unattainable — only the skull-bearer [realizes it].", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v46", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v46-v1", "l0_input_hash": "3740049f03e267be43acea357cc673c493f4fc05e221bbb79f301476e4a9f22e", "input_hash": "3740049f03e267be43acea357cc673c493f4fc05e221bbb79f301476e4a9f22e"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v47", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v47-v1", "input_hash": "31a46a3ffe87ce2a5bd605641b9c685637f28cd5abfcb2f61238f07f5f670072", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:50.124111+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "It is hard to know, hard to worship, in every way, among all creatures.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v47", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v47-v1", "l0_input_hash": "31a46a3ffe87ce2a5bd605641b9c685637f28cd5abfcb2f61238f07f5f670072", "input_hash": "31a46a3ffe87ce2a5bd605641b9c685637f28cd5abfcb2f61238f07f5f670072"}}, "l2": {"text": "It is difficult to cognize and difficult to propitiate, in all respects, among all living beings.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v47", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v47-v1", "l0_input_hash": "31a46a3ffe87ce2a5bd605641b9c685637f28cd5abfcb2f61238f07f5f670072", "input_hash": "31a46a3ffe87ce2a5bd605641b9c685637f28cd5abfcb2f61238f07f5f670072"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v48", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v48-v1", "input_hash": "bda411948c18c8e5ebe7fcf5074c719a3b30f9ed6782f06478e20c2ff47ad61f", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:50.153131+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Indeed, even when spoken by all, it is unapproachable, and it is excluded from all states/beings.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v48", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v48-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bda411948c18c8e5ebe7fcf5074c719a3b30f9ed6782f06478e20c2ff47ad61f", "input_hash": "bda411948c18c8e5ebe7fcf5074c719a3b30f9ed6782f06478e20c2ff47ad61f"}}, "l2": {"text": "Indeed, it remains inaccessible even when proclaimed by everyone, and it is devoid of all manifest states.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v48", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v48-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bda411948c18c8e5ebe7fcf5074c719a3b30f9ed6782f06478e20c2ff47ad61f", "input_hash": "bda411948c18c8e5ebe7fcf5074c719a3b30f9ed6782f06478e20c2ff47ad61f"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v49", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v49-v1", "input_hash": "bf1a448cfd538605b71bf19d088dcd9986b14deca9ee77611cfbbaeb70878e61", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:50.186244+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Among all beings, O knower of reality, it is not to be disclosed, being incomparable even to the mind.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v49", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v49-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bf1a448cfd538605b71bf19d088dcd9986b14deca9ee77611cfbbaeb70878e61", "input_hash": "bf1a448cfd538605b71bf19d088dcd9986b14deca9ee77611cfbbaeb70878e61"}}, "l2": {"text": "O knower of being, among all creatures it must not be revealed, for it is not like even the mind.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v49", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v49-v1", "l0_input_hash": "bf1a448cfd538605b71bf19d088dcd9986b14deca9ee77611cfbbaeb70878e61", "input_hash": "bf1a448cfd538605b71bf19d088dcd9986b14deca9ee77611cfbbaeb70878e61"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v50", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v50-v1", "input_hash": "99b1013037bbc9c61ed1e624a79d1ad548456b81c713910ba5ea4c5b745c4dd8", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:19:50.226705+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Today I will tell you that which accomplishes the complete dissolution of everything.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v50", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v50-v1", "l0_input_hash": "99b1013037bbc9c61ed1e624a79d1ad548456b81c713910ba5ea4c5b745c4dd8", "input_hash": "99b1013037bbc9c61ed1e624a79d1ad548456b81c713910ba5ea4c5b745c4dd8"}}, "l2": {"text": "Now I shall teach you what brings about the total withdrawal/dissolution of all things.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v50", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v50-v1", "l0_input_hash": "99b1013037bbc9c61ed1e624a79d1ad548456b81c713910ba5ea4c5b745c4dd8", "input_hash": "99b1013037bbc9c61ed1e624a79d1ad548456b81c713910ba5ea4c5b745c4dd8"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v88", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v88-v1", "input_hash": "b5dc31b71ef98d950a95fca2038d5672335bf93be6f35c841ddcf5765a267f2a", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.462153+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "The mantra-perfected ones (siddhas) are twenty-four; at the melāpa (coming-together/merge), twelve are taught.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v88", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v88-v1", "l0_input_hash": "b5dc31b71ef98d950a95fca2038d5672335bf93be6f35c841ddcf5765a267f2a", "input_hash": "b5dc31b71ef98d950a95fca2038d5672335bf93be6f35c841ddcf5765a267f2a"}}, "l2": {"text": "Those perfected through mantra are twenty-four; at the melāpa, twelve are declared.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v88", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v88-v1", "l0_input_hash": "b5dc31b71ef98d950a95fca2038d5672335bf93be6f35c841ddcf5765a267f2a", "input_hash": "b5dc31b71ef98d950a95fca2038d5672335bf93be6f35c841ddcf5765a267f2a"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v89", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v89-v1", "input_hash": "76bf658fa1b59c33770081f2fdf48ade5dcba482577d0de81c837600b4d95110", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.491863+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "They have been stated in brief, and as they are regarded in the khecakra (sky-wheel).", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v89", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v89-v1", "l0_input_hash": "76bf658fa1b59c33770081f2fdf48ade5dcba482577d0de81c837600b4d95110", "input_hash": "76bf658fa1b59c33770081f2fdf48ade5dcba482577d0de81c837600b4d95110"}}, "l2": {"text": "Thus they have been told in sum, just as they are held in the khecakra.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v89", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v89-v1", "l0_input_hash": "76bf658fa1b59c33770081f2fdf48ade5dcba482577d0de81c837600b4d95110", "input_hash": "76bf658fa1b59c33770081f2fdf48ade5dcba482577d0de81c837600b4d95110"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v90", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v90-v1", "input_hash": "68efab23c40ba320f2d289d6a4e020a31dcb90196cecd9a1f44f43213627d282", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.521674+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Their knowledge is, as it were, the mantra; the melāpa, O great-minded one, [is that] indeed.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v90", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v90-v1", "l0_input_hash": "68efab23c40ba320f2d289d6a4e020a31dcb90196cecd9a1f44f43213627d282", "input_hash": "68efab23c40ba320f2d289d6a4e020a31dcb90196cecd9a1f44f43213627d282"}}, "l2": {"text": "Their gnosis is the mantra, and the melāpa is that very thing, O wise one.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v90", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v90-v1", "l0_input_hash": "68efab23c40ba320f2d289d6a4e020a31dcb90196cecd9a1f44f43213627d282", "input_hash": "68efab23c40ba320f2d289d6a4e020a31dcb90196cecd9a1f44f43213627d282"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v91", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v91-v1", "input_hash": "e31a239aee2b9cd343804ac906b8a82bfb611abf75eda53eb16f702862d3e397", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.551813+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "By that very intrinsic form, the Lord of the void (vyoman) [is realized] from all states/beings.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v91", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v91-v1", "l0_input_hash": "e31a239aee2b9cd343804ac906b8a82bfb611abf75eda53eb16f702862d3e397", "input_hash": "e31a239aee2b9cd343804ac906b8a82bfb611abf75eda53eb16f702862d3e397"}}, "l2": {"text": "Through that very form, the Lord of the Void is [known] from everything whatsoever.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v91", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v91-v1", "l0_input_hash": "e31a239aee2b9cd343804ac906b8a82bfb611abf75eda53eb16f702862d3e397", "input_hash": "e31a239aee2b9cd343804ac906b8a82bfb611abf75eda53eb16f702862d3e397"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v92", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v92-v1", "input_hash": "4904794c841b30b3b3943dd9a373b062a85ee651644136faf67756f1ed464147", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.588834+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Out of affection for you I shall speak it at length, according to the rule.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v92", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v92-v1", "l0_input_hash": "4904794c841b30b3b3943dd9a373b062a85ee651644136faf67756f1ed464147", "input_hash": "4904794c841b30b3b3943dd9a373b062a85ee651644136faf67756f1ed464147"}}, "l2": {"text": "For love of you, I will expound it in full, as is proper.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v92", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v92-v1", "l0_input_hash": "4904794c841b30b3b3943dd9a373b062a85ee651644136faf67756f1ed464147", "input_hash": "4904794c841b30b3b3943dd9a373b062a85ee651644136faf67756f1ed464147"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
{"layer": "L1L2", "object_id": "kramasadbhava:v93", "version": "l1l2-kramasadbhava:v93-v1", "input_hash": "ed48072d67e3534df69873b3fb06717189fdca56173eef84adea407353991807", "input_refs": [], "status": "GENERATED", "created_by": "autonomy-controller", "created_at": "2026-08-13T04:33:22.619837+00:00", "supersedes": null, "superseded": false, "payload": {"layer": "L1L2", "l1": {"text": "Of the sixteen, that which is to be known is the knowledge-form, the supreme-and-other (parāpara).", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v93", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v93-v1", "l0_input_hash": "ed48072d67e3534df69873b3fb06717189fdca56173eef84adea407353991807", "input_hash": "ed48072d67e3534df69873b3fb06717189fdca56173eef84adea407353991807"}}, "l2": {"text": "Among the sixteen, what is to be known is the form of awareness itself, which is both supreme and relative.", "provenance": {"passage_id": "kramasadbhava:v93", "l0_version": "l0-kramasadbhava:v93-v1", "l0_input_hash": "ed48072d67e3534df69873b3fb06717189fdca56173eef84adea407353991807", "input_hash": "ed48072d67e3534df69873b3fb06717189fdca56173eef84adea407353991807"}}, "_generation_status": "MACHINE_PROPOSED"}, "review_events": []}
